# Required for cNFT listing (DAS). Use Helius Devnet — the public Solana RPC
# does not expose getAsset / getAssetsByGroup.
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_HELIUS_API_KEY

# Deployed Anchor program id (base58). After `anchor deploy`, paste the program id here
# so the frontend matches your deployment. If omitted, the app uses `address` from
# `src/idl/scholarfi_lite_contracts.json`.
# VITE_PROGRAM_ID=7JTpTv6ftwRJwyXasGjU7L1swFnrizKh7nEeHnSbVMbs

# Smoke-test after deploy:
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` and set VITE_PROGRAM_ID + VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL (Helius).
# 2. `npm run dev`, connect a funded teacher wallet on Devnet.
# 3. Validar árbol público → crear colección BubblegumV2 → emitir logro NFT.
# 4. Confirmar TX (register + mintV2) y cNFT vía Explorer / DAS.
